    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d35d0e1530830e42b12a5e80d0329dc, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Carr\xE9ment\u2026J\u2019avais tout ce que je voulais !"
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4db0d9531338cfe4ea4e57a3339c89c1, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 15a032d1f64921b49a6cec6c0a26887d, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - " Mes parents \xE9taient un peu stricts, mais j\u2019arrivais \xE0 leur \xE9chapper."
    - "I\xE7i, je suis coinc\xE9\u2026"
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4db0d9531338cfe4ea4e57a3339c89c1, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3973df86522e4b743879172e3518e737, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Enfin c\u2019est pas pour dire que vous \xEAtes stricts ou quoi !\r\n"
